(1. What it is) Tj
0 -16 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(Gateway Guard is the desktop agent that sits on the employee PC.) Tj
0 -16 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(It watches AI websites the company has marked as targets) Tj
0 -16 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(\(ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, DeepSeek, and the rest of the target list\).) Tj
0 -16 Td
/F1 11 Tf
