0 -16 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(Desktop agent: Python 3, packaged with PyInstaller into Gateway_Guard.exe.) Tj
0 -16 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(Local proxy: mitmproxy, started by that same exe.) Tj
0 -16 Td
/F1 11 Tf
